# AZ-104 Lab: Manage Identities and Governance in Azure

## Overview

This lab focuses on identity management, access control, and governance within Microsoft Azure. The objective is to gain hands-on experience with Microsoft Entra ID, Azure RBAC, Azure Policy, Resource Locks, Management Groups, and Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR).

---

## Learning Objectives

- Create and manage Microsoft Entra ID users
- Create and manage security groups
- Implement Azure Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
- Configure Azure Policy
- Apply Resource Locks
- Configure Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR)
- Understand Management Group hierarchy
- Create custom RBAC roles

---

